## 2. Setting Up EJS (Frontend Templating)

**What is EJS?**
EJS (Embedded JavaScript) is like HTML but **dynamic** â€” it can execute JS expressions inside `<%= %>` tags.

| | HTML | EJS |
|---|---|---|
| Static text | `<h1>2+2</h1>` â†’ shows "2+2" | â€” |
| Dynamic expression | â€” | `<h1><%= 2+2 %></h1>` â†’ shows "4" |

```bash
npm i ejs
```

```js
